	<div role="main" class="main">
		<section class="page-header">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section_ssx_roles_title_bg"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><ul class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>SSX Roles</li><li>Market Participant</li><li class="active">Role of Market Participant</li></ul></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><h1>Role of Market Participant</h1></div></div></div>

			</div>
		</section>
		<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12">
<p>The SSX enjoys a unique position that allows us to source, create and offer a range of companies that are different from those available in Australia today. Our broad international links, flexible approach and nimble development cycle have allowed us to identify opportunities that meet domestic and international demand for investment companies that will add diversity and growth opportunities to both individual and institutional investor portfolios.</p>
<p>Our renewed focus on nanocap listings, as well as brand new opportunities in resources, technology, property and international OTC, is growing a market designed to complement and enhance Australia&rsquo;s vibrant investment ecosystem.</p>
<p>SSX market participants are professionals who buy, sell, and trade shares for clients. Choosing a market participant is an essential step towards operating in the SSX stock market.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
